{
  "slug": "snipara",
  "name": "Snipara",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Context optimization + safe code execution - Query docs (90% token reduction), orchestrate multi-round exploration, and execute code with Docker isolation using RLM Runtime",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **20 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `chunk-implement` (Implement complex features by breaking them into chunks, querying Snipara for context, and using RLM Runtime for safe…), `execute-code` (Execute code safely using RLM Runtime with Docker isolation when you need to run tests, validate implementations, or…), `orchestrate` (Perform multi-round context exploration when a simple query isn't sufficient), `plan-task` (Use Snipara's planning tools when the user asks you to implement a complex feature, refactor code, or tackle…), `query-docs` (Query Snipara documentation when you need context about the codebase, APIs, architecture, or implementation details), `recall-context` (Recall previous context, decisions, or learnings from past interactions)\n- **Commands** (20): `decompose` (Break complex queries into manageable sub-queries), `docker` (Execute code using RLM Runtime with Docker isolation (recommended)), `full-mode` (Start FULL mode workflow for complex features with RLM Runtime integration), `inject` (Set session context that applies to all subsequent queries), `lite-mode` (Start LITE mode workflow for quick bug fixes and small features), `load-document` (Load raw document content by file path from Snipara (PRO+ plan)), `load-project` (Load structured map of all project documents with token budgeting (TEAM+ plan)), `login` (Sign in to Snipara via browser (auto-creates free account if needed)), and 12 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install snipara@claude-community` from `alopez3006/snipara-claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 20
  },
